%% D3: one student message through the Turn API. Step notes: NOTES.md
%%{init: {"sequence": {"actorMargin": 24, "width": 130}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Student client
  participant API as Turn API
  participant ENG as engine.step
  participant LLM as LLM
  participant DEC as Decisions API
  participant DB as Postgres

  C->>API: POST action
  API->>DB: load attempt
  Note over API: safeguards
  API->>ENG: step(message)
  ENG->>LLM: character reply
  LLM-->>ENG: reply
  ENG-->>API: state, events, view
  API->>DB: save
  API-->>C: view, pendingCheckIds

  Note over API,DB: after the response
  alt Decisions
    API->>DEC: post-turn check
    DEC-->>API: probabilities
  else fallback
    API->>LLM: post-turn check
    LLM-->>API: findings
  end
  API->>ENG: step(postTurn)
  ENG-->>API: events
  API->>DB: save events, flags

  loop check pending
    C->>API: refresh
    API-->>C: view
  end
